  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Some of the machinery powered back on in\nresponse to your presence...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006D00650020006F006600200074006800650020006D0061006300680069006E00650072007900200070006F007700650072006500640020006200610063006B0020006F006E00200069006E000A0072006500730070006F006E0073006500200074006F00200079006F00750072002000700072006500730065006E00630065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Initiating security protocols...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMega Stones detected. Restoring power to critical\nsystems.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Activating Project M.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis project is highly dangerous. Would you still\nlike to release the locks?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Release the locks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006C006500610073006500200074006800650020006C006F0063006B00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Never mind",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00650076006500720020006D0069006E00640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Now, now, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, what do\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthink<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou’re<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndoing?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004E006F0077002C0020006E006F0077002C00200010000201000000002C0020007700680061007400200064006F000A0079006F007500100001BE00000A007400680069006E006B00100001BE00000A0079006F007520190072006500100001BE00000A0064006F0069006E0067003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mewtwo is an extremely dangerous Pokémon.\nYou’re thinking of facing off against that thing?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then you’d better not fail to catch it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E00200079006F00752019006400200062006500740074006500720020006E006F00740020006600610069006C00200074006F002000630061007400630068002000690074002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Catch that Mewtwo! You can’t fail me here, kid!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061007400630068002000740068006100740020004D0065007700740077006F002100200059006F0075002000630061006E201900740020006600610069006C0020006D006500200068006500720065002C0020006B00690064002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mew!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did you not hear me saying that you HAD to catch\nthat Mewtwo?! I wasn’t kidding around!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, we all know you’re strong—no need to show\noff by going and defeating a Legendary Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI wanted you to CATCH Mewtwo, not knock it out!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, you caught it? Good. One sec...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200079006F00750020006300610075006700680074002000690074003F00200047006F006F0064002E0020004F006E00650020007300650063002E002E002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oof. Seeing this place in ruins like this...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI gotta tell you—it’s a complicated feeling, no\nmatter how long it’s been.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I figured holo-tech was called for in this situation.\nVoice calls are just so impersonal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now then, let Auntie Mable explain to you why\nyou ended up battling Mewtwo in Lysandre Labs!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tell me more, Auntie Mable",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006C006C0020006D00650020006D006F00720065002C002000410075006E0074006900650020004D00610062006C00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I take it you’ve got nothing better to do",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000740061006B006500200069007400200079006F007520190076006500200067006F00740020006E006F007400680069006E0067002000620065007400740065007200200074006F00200064006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Very nice. I do enjoy a good, attentive listener.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065007200790020006E006900630065002E0020004900200064006F00200065006E006A006F00790020006100200067006F006F0064002C00200061007400740065006E00740069007600650020006C0069007300740065006E00650072002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not the reply I was expecting, but whatever! I’m\ntelling you the story anyway.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, Mewtwo is a Pokémon created by a scientist\nwho was conducting research on Pokémon DNA.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It has formidable power, which piqued Team\nFlare’s interest.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe wondered if we might be able to use Mewtwo\nin the ultimate weapon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When we heard it had been spotted in Kalos’s\nUnknown Dungeon, we went and caught it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Honestly, we still don’t know why Mewtwo had\neven shown up in the Kalos region.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "One theory was that Mewtwo came seeking the\npower of Mega Evolution.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut even with all five of us looking into it, we\ncouldn’t arrive at an answer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 155
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, we had pieces of both Mewtwonite X and\nMewtwonite Y, but even when we tried using ’em,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMewtwo never Mega Evolved.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Since Mewtwo tends to mostly just hang about,\nsaving up its energy for when it needs to battle...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "we put Project M on the back burner and forgot\nabout it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "007700650020007000750074002000500072006F006A0065006300740020004D0020006F006E00200074006800650020006200610063006B0020006200750072006E0065007200200061006E006400200066006F00720067006F0074000A00610062006F00750074002000690074002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But Mewtwo sure does like leaving me with\nquestions, doesn’t it? Like, why awaken now?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Was it just reacting to the Mewtwonite X and\nMewtwonite Y you have?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100730020006900740020006A0075007300740020007200650061006300740069006E006700200074006F00200074006800650020004D0065007700740077006F006E0069007400650020005800200061006E0064000A004D0065007700740077006F006E0069007400650020005900200079006F007500200068006100760065003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Which leads to the question of why you even have\nthose two Mega Stones in the first place.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But what do I know?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020007700680061007400200064006F002000490020006B006E006F0077003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe Mewtwo will be a good little Pokémon and\nlisten obediently to a Trainer with your skills.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anyway, this acting director still has a pile of\nwork awaiting her.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo I’m hanging up now. Byeee.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    }
  ],
